# SUBJECT RULES

Subject is Organization-level master data.

When a school creates a genuinely new subject:
- it becomes an Organization subject master;
- other schools can use it if needed.

Existing subjects are reused.

School-level enablement is controlled through SchoolSubject.

Class-level assignment is controlled through ClassSubject.

Do not create:
Mathematics-SchoolA,
Mathematics-SchoolB,
Mathematics-Class6,
etc.

Use one approved Mathematics master with mappings.
